  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CGD BFA 2004-7 - CGD BFA 2004</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CGD BFA 2004-7</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d till Centre de Gouvernance Democratique, lokal aktivistisk tankesmedja som anordnar debatter mellan och om politika partier, kvinnors politiska deltagande mm mm. CGD f&#xF6;ddes ur IDEA:s arbete med att &quot;ta tempen&quot; p&#xE5; den politiska utv i landet 1999. De lokala intellektuella som utf&#xF6;rde arbetet bildade ett n&#xE4;tverk som sedan blev CGD.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Center for Democratic Governance, local activist oriented think tank which organizes debates about and with political parties, about women and political participation and so on. Born out of International IDEA:s work with a democracy assessment of Burkina in 1999. Local intellectuals carried out the assessment and then formed a network which turned into CDG</narrative>
  </description>
